 and tRNA(Gln) at the wobble position. ATP is required to activate the C2 atom of the wobble base."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}